      "sc:citation": {
        "@id": "https://doi.org/10.18129/B9.bioc.SNPhood"
      },
      "sc:description": "This R package investigates and visualizes the local neighborhood of a set of SNPs of interest for NGS data such as chromatin marks or TF binding sites from ChIP-Seq or RNA-Seq experiments. It comprises a set of easy-to-use functions to extract, normalize and summarize reads for a genomic region.",
